{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41965","headline":"献张拾遗 · 李中","name":"献张拾遗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"官资清贵近丹墀，性格孤高世所稀。\n金殿日开亲凤扆，古幈时展看渔矶。\n酒醒虚阁秋帘卷，吟对疎篁夕鸟归。\n献替频陈忠誉播，鹏霄万里展雄飞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41965.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41965","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}